  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T X.1196 provides a framework for the downloadable service and content protection (SCP) scheme in the mobile Internet Protocol television (IPTV) environment. It also describes functional architecture and requirements for the downloadable service and content protection (SCP) scheme for roaming in the mobile IPTV environment.</abstract>
